{"id":"f3aa1c2ee39f3304","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-cohen-indestructible.md","title":"Cohen Forcing Preserves Stationarity on omega-one","display":"thm-cohen-indestructible — Cohen Forcing Preserves Stationarity on omega-one","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cohen-indestructible","aliases":["58-thm-cohen-indestructible"],"display":"thm-cohen-indestructible — Cohen Forcing Preserves Stationarity on omega-one","depends_on":["[[58-df-cohen]]","[[58-df-stationary]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","[[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-name]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cohen-indestructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cohen-indestructible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cohen-indestructible — Cohen Forcing Preserves Stationarity on omega-one"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"58-df-cohen\">58-df-cohen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"58-df-name\">58-df-name</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a transitive set model of ZFC, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,S,P,\\leq_P\\in M\">\\(\\kappa,S,P,\\leq_P\\in M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1^M\">\\(\\omega_1^M\\)</span> is the first uncountable ordinal computed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\in\">\\(\\Sigma_\\in\\)</span> is the pure membership signature. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}(v_0,v_1)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}(v_0,v_1)\\)</span> is the membership-language formula obtained by fully expanding the upstream stationarity predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span> is its fixed code.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\\)</span> and the canonical name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\check x^P\">\\(\\check x^P\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{(-)}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^{(-)}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M^2:x\\in y\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M^2:x\\in y\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}check\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\to\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\check x^P\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\check y^P,\\emptyset\\rangle:y\\in x\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check x^P,P)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible\\text{-}check\\text{-}name}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\to\n\\forall x\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\check x^P\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\check y^P,\\emptyset\\rangle:y\\in x\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\check x^P,P)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible}\\vdash\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\land\nP,\\leq_P,\\kappa,S,\\omega_1^M\\in M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=S\\land s(v_1)=\\omega_1^M\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner,s)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\check S^P,\\check{\\omega_1^M}^P\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}indestructible}\\vdash\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\land\nP,\\leq_P,\\kappa,S,\\omega_1^M\\in M\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CohenMembershipStructure}_S(\\mathcal M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\n\\land s(v_0)=S\\land s(v_1)=\\omega_1^M\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner,s)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\to\\forall p\\in P\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n\\left(M,p,\\ulcorner\\theta_{\\mathrm{stat}}\\urcorner,\n\\langle\\check S^P,\\check{\\omega_1^M}^P\\rangle,P,\\leq_P\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The antecedent selects a set-coded membership structure, assignment, and satisfaction recursion witnessing that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> regards <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> as stationary. The conclusion uses the same fixed formula code and explicitly constructed canonical names in the six-argument forcing relation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}(\\omega,\\kappa)\\)</span> is c.c.c.; c.c.c. forcing preserves stationary subsets of the ground-model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Stronger preservation statements for stationary subsets of larger cardinals require separate hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cohen","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cohen]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-relation","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","ancho